How about leaving them alone?  It's already barely worth killing them--
I'll do it if I stumble into a big buff pet, but the vast majority of
games I'll leave them untouched.  You can already loot the items shop
with a pet, which is really a pretty interesting part of the game for
newbies.  A couple thousand zorkmids and a few wands/potions is barely
worth the time it takes to kill them.

